    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\n`vim.lsp.inline_completion` waits a fixed 200 ms before each request. With copilot-language-server's round trip on top, around 250-400 ms, a suggestion takes about half a second to appear after typing stops. copilot.lua defaults to 15 ms and lets you change it. In core the only way is to override the private `Completor:automatic_request`.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nA way to set the delay, such as an option on `vim.lsp.inline_completion.enable()`.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
